WEBVTT

00:06:59.116 --> 00:07:01.036
when the emperor,

00:07:01.076 --> 00:07:04.076
which controls the largest
country in the world,

00:07:04.116 --> 00:07:06.156
feels that, "Hey, this is not enough.

00:07:06.196 --> 00:07:07.316
I need more."

00:07:08.076 --> 00:07:10.636
And sends his army to capture,

00:07:10.676 --> 00:07:12.396
to extend the empire.

00:07:13.036 --> 00:07:14.716
BG: I said at the beginning

00:07:14.756 --> 00:07:17.196
that it's difficult, of course,
to make predictions.

00:07:17.196 --> 00:07:19.876
But yesterday, you published
an article in "The Guardian"

00:07:19.916 --> 00:07:22.676
titled: “Why Putin
has already lost this war.”

00:07:22.676 --> 00:07:23.956
Please explain.

00:07:24.316 --> 00:07:26.356
YNH: Well, one thing should be very clear.

00:07:26.356 --> 00:07:28.036
I don't mean to say

00:07:28.036 --> 00:07:31.436
that he's going to suffer
an immediate military defeat.